#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rebalance.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rebalance"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rebalance:1 of
msgid "Make data more balanced across entire cluster."
msgstr "使数据在整个集群中更加均衡。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rebalance:3 of
msgid ""
"LiteFrame is only ever chunked along the row axis (axis 0); ``axis`` is "
"accepted for API parity with ``DataFrame.rebalance`` but should remain 0."
msgstr ""
"LiteFrame 只沿行轴（axis 0）进行分块；接受 ``axis`` 参数是为了与 ``"
"DataFrame.rebalance`` 的 API 保持一致，但应保持为 0。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rebalance.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rebalance:6 of
msgid "The axis to rebalance."
msgstr "要重新平衡的轴。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rebalance:8 of
msgid ""
"Specified so the number of chunks after balance along the selected axis "
"per plane is ``chunk_shape[axis] * factor``."
msgstr "指定每个平面沿选定轴平衡后的块数量为 ``chunk_shape[axis] * factor``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rebalance:11 of
msgid "Specified so the number of chunks are at most num_partitions."
msgstr "指定块的数量最多为 num_partitions。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rebalance:14 of
msgid ""
"Hint to rebalance without first resolving unknown row shapes.  When True,"
" rebalance may partition the row axis using a per-chunk size estimate "
"(``rough_size_ratio``) instead of waiting for real (resolved) shapes. "
"This only has an effect when the row shape is unknown **and** the source "
"chunks carry such an estimate; currently that estimate is produced only "
"by SIZE-mode ``read_odps_table`` reads. In every other case -- known "
"shapes, or an unknown row axis with no estimate -- ``rough=True`` "
"silently falls back to the normal path (resolving real shapes then "
"rechunking). The estimate is approximate, so the output is balanced by "
"estimated share, not exactly equal in size."
msgstr ""
"在不解析未知行形状的情况下重新平衡的提示。当为 True 时，重新平衡可能使用"
"每块大小估计值（``rough_size_ratio``）来划分行轴，而不是等待实际（解析的"
"）形状。这仅在行形状未知**且**源块携带此类估计值时才有效；目前该估计值仅"
"由 SIZE 模式的 ``read_odps_table`` 读取生成。在所有其他情况下——已知形状，"
"或没有估计值的未知行轴——``rough=True`` 将静默回退到正常路径（解析实际形状"
"然后重新分块）。估计值是近似的，因此输出按估计份额平衡，而不是完全相等的"
"大小。"

